 "text": "9/29/26, 9:39 AM\ne EMDKOOOI1 (IS-U utility contract: include subscreens and check fields)\n\n1 Note\n\nYou can find these enhancements in Customizing under |sSAP Utilities } Tools System Modifications } SAP Enhancements\nDefine SAP Enhancements\n\nBusiness Add-Ins (BAdIs)\ne ISU_MOVEIN_CUSTOMIZE: (IS-U: Customizing \u2014 override move-in processing)\nUsed to override Customizing settings in the move-in.\nFor more information see the Badl documentation.\ne ISU_MOVEIN_MENUE (IS-U: menu enhancement for move-in)\nUsed to enhance the menu of the move-in screen. Enables you to add entries to the menu bar.\nFor more information see the Badl documentation.\ne ISU_MOVEOUT_MENUE (IS-U: menu enhancement for move-out)\nUsed to enhance the menu of the move-out screen. Enables you to add entries to the menu bar.\n\nFor more information see the Badl documentation.\n\nContract Change without Invoicing\n\nUse\n\nThe function for changing a contract without invoicing enables you to change the payment form of some of the contracts ina\ncontract account without triggering separate invoicing.\n\nIntegration\n\nYou can use the contract change without invoicing from the move-in/out function. You can also reverse a contract change without\ninvoicing.\n\nPrerequisites\n\nYou can use the contract change without invoicing function in a move-in/out when the contracts have already been included in an\ninvoiced billing document.\n\nPrerequisite: You have configured the contract change reasons in Customizing under Define Reasons forContract Change so that\n\nthe new field nl (contract change without invoicing) is selected. The settings for reposting receivables during the customer\nchange also have to be maintained here in the field UBU (Repost Open Items for Move-In/Out).\n",
